      en: ["Distance from Bandar Seri Begawan is approximately 10 km.", "Area size is about 5 square kilometers.", "Estimated population in 2023 is 8,000.", "First school established in 1965.", "Average elevation is 15 meters above sea level.", "Number of households recorded at 1,200 in 2020."],
